{"version":1,"content":"<p>九龍塘開餐並非以大型商場為核心不可，區內其實也有不少「隱藏」特色餐廳和小店，包括由名廚主理的私房粵菜館、法國藍帶廚師坐鎮的西餐廳，以及寵物友善Cafe。</p><p>喜歡發掘不同滋味的你，是時候走到核心外圍，展開一趟尋味之旅。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;精緻手</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:31:28.912479+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T06:00:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:34.201627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:34.201627+00:00","content_hash":"dc8a192502fad6f010f21184c4e52a4ec500bf38fe3157d192adcd266be95817","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}